{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>QuellCut 是一款智能影片剪輯工具，專為播客主持、YouTuber、教育工作者及內容創作者而設，可自動偵測並移除影片中的靜音段落，節省大量手動剪輯時間。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費，適合想快速整理影片節奏、提升成品質素的使用者。</p>\n\n<h2>智能移除靜音</h2>\n<p>QuellCut 會分析音訊波形，自動找出所有停頓與靜音位置，並提供安靜房間、一般及嘈雜環境等預設靈敏度。除了移除靜音，亦可偵測「um」、「uh」等填充詞與重複語句，方便一鍵清理。影片可保持原始比例輸出，並支援垂直 9:16 Shorts 剪輯，適合快速製作社交平台短片。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-550-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-551-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-552-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-553-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-554-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-555-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：QuellCut – Silence Remover</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T00:38:59.182222+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}